{"id":"vod_lz_80435","vodId":"80435","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"战国妖狐救世姐弟篇","name_cn":"战国妖狐救世姐弟篇","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20240110-1/da7e0f590dfe8169ea4ea55087918223.jpg"},"summary":"　　时间为战国时代，世上所具有的各种魑魅魍魉、异形妖怪等非人灵力生物总称为”暗“。喜欢人类的暗——妖狐玉，以及厌恶人类的仙道——迅火，成立了名为“救世姐弟”的组合进行著扫荡罪恶的救世活动，途中遇上了武士兵头真介。另外还有一群专门对付暗的僧侣·断怪众，他们为了消灭对人类作恶的暗“障怪”的以不人道的方式进行人体改造，迅火等人与他们产生激烈冲突！人类当中也有坏人，非人类的存在也不见得都是邪恶的，迅火因过去的事而极其讨厌人类，但在旅程当中，也逐渐目睹到人类善良的一面，他是否能有所转变呢。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,奇幻,古装"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-03 23:48:07","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240110/33620_b4af2ce7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240117/33822_e7a27f5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240124/34071_844b5a8c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240201/34288_f84fccae/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240208/34559_3733fb37/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240214/34812_f4923929/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240221/35034_a91abc27/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240228/35287_deec0428/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240307/35557_774210d4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240313/35794_9a1387bb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240320/36116_e38804d4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240328/36376_47d96d05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240403/36549_14ebda12/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:27.227Z"}